{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56038","headline":"偈 · 智寂","name":"偈","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"以字不是八不成，森罗万像此中明。\n直饶巧说千般妙，不是讴阿（一作「沤和」）不是经。\n（见《景德传灯录》卷二十二、《五灯会元》卷十五）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"智寂","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56038.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56038","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}